  "notes": "{味付|あじつ}け refers to the act of seasoning food or the resulting flavor.\n\nUSAGE:\nUsed with する: {味付|あじつ}けする (to season)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {味付|あじつ}け⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to add seasoning\n- {味付|あじつ}け⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{濃|こ}い→濃い：02344_koi⟧: heavily seasoned\n- {味付|あじつ}け⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{薄|うす}い→薄い：00764_usui⟧: lightly seasoned\n- {味付|あじつ}け⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{良|い}い→良い：02350_yoi⟧: well-seasoned\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {味付|あじつ}け⟦{海苔|のり}→海苔：10391_nori⟧: seasoned seaweed\n- {味付|あじつ}け⟦{肉|にく}→肉：02240_niku⟧: seasoned meat\n\nNOTE:\nRefers to both the seasoning process and the resulting flavor profile.",
